Error [E0068]: This callable uses the retired result-arrow shape.
  --> tests/ui/bare_return_needs_value.jet:1:17
    |
  1 | fn g(xs: [Int]) => Int {
    |                 ^^
 Why: a return type sits after the parameter list, and `->` introduces the body; an effect ceiling follows the return type
 Fix: write `fn name(...) Type -> body`, or `fn name(...) Type -[Effects]> { … }`

Error [E0405]: `?? return` here needs a value
  --> tests/ui/bare_return_needs_value.jet:2:24
    |
  2 |     x := xs.first() ?? return
    |                        ^^^^^^
 Why: a bare `return` needs a value here because the function returns Int (a whole number)
 Fix: give a fallback value: `?? return <value>`
